          "image_1"
        ],
        "section_id": "condition:1"
      },
      {
        "key": "answer",
        "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">6</span></p>",
        "title": "Ответ",
        "asset_keys": [],
        "section_id": "answer:1"
      },
      {
        "key": "solution",
        "html": "<p>Пло­щадь вы­де­лен­ной фи­гу­ры равна раз­но­сти зна­че­ний пер­во­об­раз­ных, вы­чис­лен­ных в точ­ках <span data-inline-latex=\"11\"></span> и <span data-inline-latex=\"9\"></span>. Имеем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"F(11)=2\\cdot 11^{3}-60\\cdot 11^{2}+601\\cdot 11-\\frac{12}{7}=2011\\frac{2}{7}\"></span> . <br/><span data-inline-latex=\"F(9)=2\\cdot 9^{3}-60\\cdot 9^{2}+601\\cdot 9-\\frac{12}{7}=2005\\frac{2}{7}\"></span> . <br/><span data-inline-latex=\"F(11)-F(9)=2011\\frac{2}{7}-2005\\frac{2}{7}=6\"></span>.</p><p></p><p></p></center>",
        "title": "Решение",
